      "shallow bell canopy with a stronger center rise",
      "coral-burgundy and turquoise fascia rhythm with brass trim",
      "jewel-like eight-point central crown instead of a reference ornament",
      "twelve slim brass supports",
      "twelve stylized mounts in staggered inner and outer rings",
      "warm ivory, pale gray and chestnut mounts with varied coral/turquoise tack",
      "layered dark-coral platform with brass inset plaques",
      "small authored boarding step",
      "bright readable classic-tycoon color energy without copying reference geometry"
